window.products.push({"id":1060074,"name":"Palace Imports 100% Solid Wood 2-Sliding Door Wardrobe/Armoire/Closet/Mudroom Storage, Java Color. 1 Large Shelf, 1 Clothing Rod Included. Extra Optio","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91-wgZ7UWnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A smaller cousin of the three sliding door wardrobe, it can still store a lot on a small footprint! With the sliding doors, no precious extra space is needed to open them. Fully customizable, you have total control over the wardrobe’s configurations by changing its layout to fit your needs: up to three large shelves can be added, a clothing rod can be left out and each removable shelf has three adjustable positions. You can choose from raised panel doors in Honey Pine or Mahogany colors or louver doors in Java color. The doors slide on two tracks and only one opening is available at a time. The wardrobe’s functionality is enhanced by the aesthetics of the all wood construction. 100% pine wood is beautiful, but to balance its knotty nature, wood veneer is used on large panels over solid wood boards. This gives it a silky smooth feel and a spot-free appeal. Available in three hand painted finishes it can match your interior or you can choose from other Palace Imports’ perfectly compatible furniture pieces.Overall Size: 36\"w x 72\"h x 22.5\"dColors: Mahogany, Honey Pine, JavaColor/Wood Samples: Actual color may vary. Wood samples mailed out for color matching upon requestPaint: Lead-free polyurethane compliant with the U.S. Federal Hazardous Substances ActConstruction:- Two solid wood cross ties and two bars at the top for extra stability- Two 4mm (5/32”) plywood back panels nailed to frame creating robust structure- Top flush with side panels to allow combining unlimited number of wardrobesNumber of Doors: 2Door Type: Louver with bronze pullsDoor Closing Mechanism:- Bottom rolling system with track and guide channel- Doors are sliding independently- Only one door opening available at a timeConfigurations:- 1 shelf (standard)- 2 shelves (1 shelf sold separately)- 3 shelves (2 shelves sold separately)- 4 shelves (3 shelves sold separately)- Bottom 3 shelves are removable and have three adjustable positions- 2- and 3-Sliding Door Wardrobes can be combined to create wardrobes of varying widthsMaterial: 100% Pine wood. Large panels have wood veneer over solid woodWood Quality: Pine is kiln dried to prevent splitting and size distortionCompatibility: Other matching pieces available in identical color and style from Palace ImportsAssembly: Requires assembly. Only screwdriver/screw gun and hammer needed.Shipping:- Ships flat in two boxes- Factory boxes packaged into additional double-wall carton boxes in USA for best protectionEcology: “Smart Wood” sustainable tree farms are the only source of all wood as required by Brazilian lawCountry of Origin: Brazil","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91-wgZ7UWnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Palace Imports","source_asin":"B00H5WYJXA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1060074","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00H5WYJXA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00H5WYJXA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
