window.products.push({"id":1060287,"name":"Range Kleen , Red Enameled, 2 Shelf Wall Mounted Pot Rack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HkTX-6q5L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Who can’t use a little extra room in the kitchen? Chefs rely on overhead racks like Range Kleen CW6003R, Red Enameled, 2 Shelf Wall Mounted Pot Rack to keep cookware organized, within easy reach that gives extra space in the kitchen. Shelf Wall Mounted Pot Rack is an excellent source of storage for tighter spaces! Great for condominiums and apartments; especially where cabinet space is limited. This shelf is a great way to display cookbooks, plants and other decorative pieces that add flair to your kitchen's style! Plus, the red color of the rack will make it stunning and a sure head turner for everyone. This rack is made from powder-coated steel that makes it strong and durable, can be easily mounted on the wall as it comes with mountable hardware. The oval-shaped rack has a modern style; it comes with hooks that can be used to keep the utensils off the ground and handy. These additional hooks and a grid are ideal to hang your extra cookware like skillets, pans, or other such utensils.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HkTX-6q5L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Range Kleen","source_asin":"B000VYK6JA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1060287","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000VYK6JA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000VYK6JA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1060288,"name":"Lolita Hand Painted Rocks Glass, I Still Believe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/519ARYwZ6YL._AC_.jpg","description":"To put it simply, at Santa Barbara Design Studio, we make what we love and we love what we make. The one and only…Lolita. It all started with a girls' night out. One that contained more than the usual laughter and fun. Browsing for the first time through a martini menu, Lolita was inspired by the recipes. After being served a Cosmopolitan, her creative imagination made her see the glass differently, the way she thought it should be, a bit more dressed up, perhaps with a pattern, with flair and with a fabulous recipe on the bottom. Lolita took hold of that original idea, hand painted martini glasses, and then took the world by storm in 2004 to become the hottest gift brand in the U.S. Now, after many successful products, designs and collections, she continues to stand behind what she has always believed...that life should be lived to its fullest and every moment should be celebrated. What is your moment? Commemorate it with a wine, margarita or martini glass, a shooter, rocks glass or pilsner. For whichever of life's big moments, there is a Lolita style to fit it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/519ARYwZ6YL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Santa Barbara Design Studio","source_asin":"B007QCSSCW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1060288","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B007QCSSCW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B007QCSSCW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
