window.products.push({"id":1060295,"name":"Nambe Twist Goblet, Clear","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31633M2yl+L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Pretty up your every-day table with the Twist Goblet. The full-lead crystal bowl and Nambé metal stem combination encourage good cheer. You'll find the twisting grooves of the metal offer easy handling. Use for sparkling water and couple with either the Twist Wine Glass or Twist Flute for harmony on your table. Wash by hand and dry immediately for the best results. Amazon.com The stunning Twist collection of stemware is a daring creation of Nambé designer Fred Bould. Imparting his love of water and motion and the spiraling helix shape, each stemmed glass melds a combination of two materials: a perfectly smooth crystal bowl and a metal alloy stem that twists to create light and shadow. The Twist goblet stands an impressive 10-1/2 inches tall, utterly dynamic and graceful. Not only does the stem provide textural pleasure but release from worries about breakage. The full-lead crystal bowl, in a classic tulip shape crafted by skilled European artisans, holds up to 18 ounces of red wine or sparkling water, and refracts light brilliantly. After use, the glass should be washed by hand and dried immediately to prevent spotting. Nambé Twist stemware comes gift-boxed and ready to delight. Nambé was founded in 1951 in a village of the same name in scenic northern New Mexico. From the beginning, the company focused on hand-producing high-quality, functional items such as sand-cast metal bowls and trays with great attention to timeless, modern design. Porcelain tableware also now joins Nambé crystal and metal lines, all of which make exceptional gifts for the most special of occasions. Nambé ware has won numerous design awards, has been shown in or recognized by nearly two dozen museums worldwide, and is part of the permanent collections of many, including the Museum of Modern Art in New York. --Ann Bieri","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31633M2yl+L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Namb","source_asin":"B0009DR056","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1060295","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0009DR056","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0009DR056","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
