window.products.push({"id":1060410,"name":"LiveWire Insulated Water Bottle with 4 LIDS 2 Straws & Carrier Bag Double-Wall Vacuum Insulated Stainless Steel Water Flask Thermos Wide Mouth Reusabl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813lwKwMglL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Tired of drinking warm juice or cold coffee? You never leave home without your favorite beverage with you. Whether it’s chilled juice or a hot brew, you like to have a drink at hand when you drive your kids to school or head to the office. After all, it’s what keeps you hydrated all day. The problem is, an ordinary drink container does not keep your beverage hot or cold for long. The last thing you want when you’re thirsty and tired is to sip a beverage that isn’t as warm or chilled as it should be. Maintain your drink’s temperature with the Livewire Insulated Stainless Steel Water Bottle! Made of durable stainless steel, our insulated flask can last many years of use before showing signs of wear and tear. It stands strong against oxidation, rusting, and corrosion, and is able to withstand high impact. What’s great about our double-walled vacuum flask is it comes with a carrier bag, making it suitable for those who are always on the go. It has a shoulder strap that makes it easy to carry when you go to the gym or fitness studio. If you are looking for a stylish way to stay hydrated when you do your physical activities or are traveling, our stainless steel bottle holder will not disappoint. This practical container has a frosted matte powder coating, is designed with a laser-engraved logo, and comes in a nice branded box. Still not convinced? Here are additional reasons to make you love this insulated water bottle: ✅ Great gift idea ✅ Reusable and easy to clean ✅ Excellent alternative to plastic water bottles ✅ Leak-proof lids ✅ Multiple colors to choose from Enjoy your drink the way you want it. 👉 Add the Livewire Insulated Stainless Steel Water Bottle to your cart TODAY!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813lwKwMglL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LIVEWIRE FLASK","source_asin":"B08NJN61KF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1060410","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08NJN61KF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08NJN61KF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
