window.products.push({"id":1060438,"name":"Olee Sleep 14 Inch Dura Metal Steel Slat Bed Frame, Twin XL","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":62.51,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZsQoIEeUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Just forget the weak wood slat bed frames and the squeaking. The Olee Sleep metal steel slat frame is the answer to all frames. Easy assembly, yet strong bed frame can give your bedroom upgrade. The new legs assures you and your family member bumping in the edges. We care for your comfort, and your safety. All you need is to order and wait for the frame to arrive. All packed in a box, just waiting for you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZsQoIEeUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Olee Sleep","source_asin":"B074XK6FMP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1060438","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074XK6FMP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074XK6FMP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1060439,"name":"Smile Time Artwork by DawgArt, 18 by 24-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91j1nqMFPYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features a colorful portrait of a dog. Alicia VanNoy Call has been working on DawgArt since 2003. She takes her colorful inspiration for her paintings from the Desert Southwest. She works with various rescue and shelter groups by donating artwork to fundraising auctions to promote awareness and direct care for animals in need. Said Alicia, \"DawgArt is meant simply to bring happiness to people and to help us remember our connection with Nature.\" Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91j1nqMFPYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00NEJNY0M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1060439","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00NEJNY0M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00NEJNY0M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
