window.products.push({"id":1060478,"name":"Newport Series Modern TV Media Console Stand Entertainment Center with Two Doors and Adjustable Storage Shelves | Sturdy and Wide| Easy Assembly |Smok","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":149.51,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Xr36hAACL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔DESIGNED FOR STYLE AND FUNCTIONALITY: This quality Mid-Century multi-tasker can enhance the look of your living room, den or family room. Not only does it showcases your TV, but it also helps you stay organized by serving as storage space for your books, DVDs, game consoles, and other media equipment. Durable, thick ,and high-pressure laminate will better withstand daily use and abuse than pure wood or veneer. ✔BEST FRIEND TO LIVING AREAS AND ENTERTAINMENT SPACES: Need to change stands after upgrade your Flat Screen TV? No Worry! This stand can fit all size tv up to 70 in. Set the stage for big game, a movie marathon, or that season finale everyone’s been talking about, elegant design will decorate your house perfectly. ✔WELL CONSTRUCTED AND DURABLE USE: Our professional designers have tested everything, from weight capacity to safety during transition, guaranteeing you will receive our products in the perfect condition. 2 large door storage with adjustable shelving giving spacious room for DVD，router, audio equipment，discs，video games, etc. Cable management holes hides all other A/V essentials out of sight. ✔EASY ASSEMBLY & CLEANING: Assembly required with easy-to-follow instruction. We also provide instructional assembly video to help you along the way. It takes no time for you to finish up this astounding long-lasting TV stand. Don't need anything other than water and towels to clean.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Xr36hAACL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Caffoz","source_asin":"B08L9S1K64","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1060478","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08L9S1K64","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08L9S1K64","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1060479,"name":"Textured Aluminum 8x8 in Round Cake Pan by Ultra Cuisine – Durable, Oven-Safe, Warp-Resistant, Easy Clean for Cooking and Baking","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81V1T16j0IL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"EASY TO CLEAN: Spend less time scrubbing! Made for easy cleanup, hand wash our textured aluminum round cake pan easily without deep scrubbing or scouring. No worries if the product ends up in the dishwasher - if discoloration occurs, this is only cosmetic, and the baking properties and safety of the cake pan are not impacted. EVEN BAKING: No more burnt bottoms! Our standard round cake pan is oven safe to 475 degrees Fahrenheit and is designed with a unique diamond texture baking surface that retains and distributes heat evenly for consistent bake of bread, cakes and treats. With a textured surface for even baking, this standard size round cake baking pan is an essential baking companion for any baker. RELIABLE, BAKE FOR A LIFETIME: Ultra Cuisine’s cake baking tin is made of high-quality aluminum that is durable, rust-resistant, food-safe and will last a lifetime. We sourced top grade aluminum in the making of this premium aluminum baking cake pan, ensuring it can withstand hot temperatures without rusting or warping! PERFECT SIZE CAKE PAN: Our textured aluminum cake pan is perfect for breads and cakes and more! Perfect size for beautifully baked bread and cake. Aluminum round cake pan dimensions are exterior 8.39 x 8.39 x 2.13-inch and interior 8 x 8 x 1.93-inch. DESIGNED IN USA: Ultra Cuisine is a small business making simple, elegant, and professional quality bakeware for families everywhere. Our diamond textured aluminum round cake pan is perfect for baking red velvet cake, vanilla cake, cornbread, crust, deep dish pie, chocolate cake, and more for family and friends during the holidays!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81V1T16j0IL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ultra Cuisine","source_asin":"B098XVPZF9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1060479","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B098XVPZF9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B098XVPZF9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1060480,"name":"Smart Digital Alarm Clock, Bedside Clock, LED Dimmable Intelligent Night Light Clock with Smart Light Sensor, Snooze Function, 12/24 Hours, Date, Temp","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.41,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51yFG9GQWSL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Product feature 1.Intelligent sensor night light function, when the ambient light is not enough to see the time, he will automatically light up the faint backlight; (This function can be switched) 2.The humanized design of looking down at the viewing angle, because most of the time, people's eyes and alarm clocks are placed in a looking down state; 3.Snooze function: When the ringtone sounds, press the top button once, the ringtone will stop, and it will continue to ring after 5 minutes; Why choose us? Auto Backlight Easy Snooze Function Large Display Easy Operate Indoor Temperature Packages: 1 x Digital alarm clock 1 x User manual Customer questions & answers Q:How about sensor light ? A:Clock doesn't light up in the day time or room is bright enough. When room's dark, sensor light enables clock to automatically give off soft lights, which is perfect at night; Sensor light can also be close, and please simply press SNOOZE/LIGHT when you're in need Q：How do you turn off the alarm (when it starts beeping)? A : Press the button on top to snooze. There is a button/switch on the back to turn off the alarm. Q：How long does the snooze button last before the alarm repeats? A : 4-6 minutes Q：Is the battery included? What type? A :Batteries are not included. Need 3*AAA batteries . Q:Is the clock time easy to set up? A :Yes. Follow the instructions on the leaflet which are a bit small 4 easy steps to follow. Q : Does it have snooze function? A : Yes, it is on the top, same button with light button, when it alarming, touch the button to get 5 more minutes sleeping.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51yFG9GQWSL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SunPlusPower","source_asin":"B08YQN392B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1060480","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08YQN392B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08YQN392B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
