window.products.push({"id":1060487,"name":"Aigostar Electric Panini Press, 1500W Stainless Steel Sandwich Maker with Adjustable Temperature Setting, Opens 180 Degree Indoor Grill with Non-stick","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615L9EHAMUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Grill & Press】 180° grill and press housing with hinged lid for healthy versatile cooking. The flat grill can work as a panini press, sandwich maker, countertop steak grill and roaster machine. Easier and healthier for different occasions. 【Temperature Control】 Intelligent temperature control with temperature range 180 - 425°F panini press sandwich maker will stop heating when the temperature has up to the preset value; preventing your grilled food from being burned. Panini maker allows you to cook thicker cuts of meat, fish, steaks, vegetables and filled paninis. 【Fast Heat 】 With 1500W high power panini press grill only takes less than 2 minutes to preheat to max temperature. The 425°F top temperature will sear steaks in minutes whilst the variable temperature gives you total control for cooking other fish and vegetables. Perfect for making a quick snack, sandwiches for lunch, or grilling up dinner. 【Non-stick Grid Plates & Removable Drip Tray】 Aluminum Alloy Plates with non-stick coating have the properties of high thermal conductivity and heating evenly. Plus easily washable drip tray, grill grease and food residue can be quickly cleaned which greatly reduce your after-meal workload. 【Light Indicator】 The red one to be power indicator, The green light is on when heating and goes out when reaching a certain temperature. While temperature falls down, it will light up again. If you have any questions you can also contact Aigostar for proper assistance.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615L9EHAMUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aigostar","source_asin":"B0894PC9S2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1060487","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0894PC9S2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0894PC9S2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1060488,"name":"Awake Your Magic Art Print","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812i9IWUijL._AC_SL1302_.jpg","description":"Illuminated by rays of a setting sun, a snowy owl flies through a forest. This wintery scene is depicted by Anne Stokes in our Awake Your Magic Art print. With a pentagram clasped in its talons, to what destiny does the owl fly? Its wings are outspread in powerful flight, eyes alert and determined. Alongside cats, owls have often been known to serve as familiars to magic users. Printed on canvas, this stunning piece of fantasy home decor comes complete with an attached wooden frame and mounting kit for easy installation. Key Features: Print features artwork by fantasy artist Anne Stokes Artwork depicts a snowy owl holding a pentagram talisman Canvas print comes with wooden frame Mounting materials included with print Stunning addition to any home decor Great gift for fantasy fans Measurements: Height: 7.5 Inches Width: 10 Inches","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812i9IWUijL._AC_SL1302_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Medieval Collectibles","source_asin":"B01BDQXBXM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1060488","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01BDQXBXM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01BDQXBXM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
