window.products.push({"id":1060580,"name":"24-Pack of Keurig Cleaning Pods For Keurig 1.0 & 2.0 Machines. K Cup Cleaner Pods Removes Stale Coffee Residue & Stains. Eco Friendly","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/815lYjqPbGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BENEFITS OF USE: Caffenu Keurig cleaning pods are one of your must-have barista accessories to be in your cleaning kit. With machine care, regular use helps maintain your machine, increasing its life span. It is quick & easy, with hygienic cleaning at the touch of a button. Our Keurig cleaner pod leaves no residue, the cleaning agent readily dissolves, & is made from environmentally kind materials. It heightens your coffee flavor & aroma by cleaning the brewing chamber. BETTER-TASTING COFFEE - Our cleaning pods for Keurig Coffee Maker is a world's first design, being the first ever capsule to clean your Keurig coffee machine. This revelation has led to cleaner coffee machines and thus fresher tasting coffee. This very first product of its kind - removes unwanted debris/build-up from the brewing needle, chamber, nozzle and spout. The fast-acting detergent and powerful cleaning/foaming action eliminate oils, tannins, granules, and odors in just 2 minutes. HOW TO USE - Using the Keurig cleaning cups is as easy as making a cup of coffee. Instructions clearly detailed below. Caffenu's K Cup Cleaner Pods are compatible with Keurig machines 1.0 and 2.0. There are clear instructions that come with the product showing you exactly how to use this product and make your coffee-drinking experience even better. Our quick clean Keurig cups are made of plant-based chemicals ensuring safety and great-tasting coffee. WHEN TO USE - The quick & clean Keurig cleaning cups are optimised at one Caffenu cleaning capsule after every 30 cups of coffee made, or at least once a month. The recommended usage for this Keurig machine cleaner might increase if you are using tea, flavored coffee or hot chocolate capsules in your machine. If you are using the Caffenu cleaning capsules for the first time on your machine, we recommend that you use 2 cleaning pods to ensure all the build-up is being removed. CAFFENU: Caffenu provides innovative solutions to care for, clean & maintain your home coffee machines. Caffenu has a diverse product range which facilitates every coffee brand out there in different ways. Caffenu has the unique capability of offering both a coffee machine cleaner & descaler, whilst focusing on pushing the horizon in optimising your coffee experience. Caffenu's product range is used to clean all coffee machine accessories, highlighting the value of the perfect cup of coffee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/815lYjqPbGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Caffenu","source_asin":"B0BZVQ8V17","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1060580","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZVQ8V17","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZVQ8V17","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
