window.products.push({"id":1060597,"name":"Sandusky WS722474-C Chrome Steel Heavy Duty Adjustable Wire Shelving, 2400 lbs Capacity, 72\" Width x 74\" Height x 24\" Depth, 4 Shelves","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":383.54,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611pfwuUrsL._SL1000_.jpg","description":"The Sandusky WS722474-C is a standing four-shelf unit made of chrome-plated steel wire to support a 600-lb. per shelf capacity and to support a 2400-lb. total capacity when the weight is distributed evenly across all the shelves. This shelf unit has an open wire design to permit greater penetration of water from fire sprinklers, permit more light and air circulation in the work space, and resist dust build-up. This unit has a chrome finish for dirt and corrosion resistance and for durability. The shelves on this unit are adjustable in 1\" increments for precise adjustment of shelf heights. This shelf unit has adjustable levelers for uneven flooring. The assembled unit is 74 x 72 x 24 inches (H x W x D). (H is height, the vertical distance from lowest to highest point; W is width, the horizontal distance from left to right; D is depth, the horizontal distance from front to back.) Assembly instructions are included. No tools are required. Standing shelf units are commonly used to store items to help create organized, efficient, and safer work areas. These systems typically consist of a frame or rack with open shelves. Added components such as casters, wheels, or handles are used for applications that require mobility. Standing shelf units are used in a variety of office, industrial, educational, and residential settings. Sandusky Lee manufactures steel storage products for office, commercial, industrial, and educational applications. The company is headquartered in Littlestown, PA.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611pfwuUrsL._SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sandusky","source_asin":"B007O3N1LG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1060597","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B007O3N1LG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B007O3N1LG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1060598,"name":"Deco 79 Leather Handmade Stool with Patchwork Pattern, 16\" x 16\" x 16\", Gray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":163.88,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91kMVMuZr2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Sit back and relax with your feet rested on this comfortable stool. The perfect combination of form and function with a stylish design. Cube leather accent stool will complement an upholstered velvet sofa with light colored pillows for a luxurious appeal. This item ships in 1 carton. Features a cream toned leather finish. Due to the handmade nature of this item, no two will be alike, there will be slight differences in shape, size, and color. Suitable for indoor use only. Leather and hair on hide are natural products, and therefore no two will be alike. There may slight variations in pattern, natural blemishes, colors, and overall aesthetic of the product. Maximum weight limit is 200 lbs. Made in India. This is a single stool. Contemporary style.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91kMVMuZr2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Deco 79","source_asin":"B0B35LY9KS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1060598","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B35LY9KS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B35LY9KS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1060599,"name":"Silicone Heart Mold Chocolate Cake - Diamond Breakable Heart Shaped Mousse Molds Tray 3D Semicircle Food Grade Baking Trays Wooden Hammers Pounding To","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61niUxAT7IL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍩All You Need To Make Hot Chocolate Bombs: Comes with 1 piece large diamond heart cake mold, measuring approx. 7.5 x 7.5 x 2.4 inch. 2 Packs 6 holes semi sphere silicone baking molds for hot cocoa bombs, measuring approx. 11 x 6.7 x 1.5 inch. 1 piece wooden hammer with smooth finish and 1 piece chocolate decorating cream syringe pen. 🍩Multi-function Tool Set: There's a multitude of uses for Tiscen silicone mousse molds from specialty cakes to everyday breads and muffins. Pudding desserts, jelly, upside-down cakes, and even chocolate bombs can be a reality in your kitchen. You can also use the diamond heart mold to make chocolate hearts filled with different desserts inside for valentine's day. You can even step outside baking and freeze your favorite juice to make flavored ice-pops. 🍩Food Grade Silicone Molds And BPA Free: Tiscen chocolate molds are made of 100% food-grade healthy silicone which is BPA free, non-toxic, odorless, durable. Can be applied within the temperature between minus 40℉ to 446℉. Non-stick and easy release design, removal from Tiscen candy molds is quick and effortless, with one twist and gentle push, your baked goods pop right out. 🍩Easy To Use And Clean: Tiscen silicone bakeware is the easiest mold to make homemade hot chocolate bombs and diamond shaped cakes, just scoop some chocolate into the molds and then pop the molds into the freezer for 5-10 minutes to set. Non-stick surface will help you release food easily. Cleanup is a breeze, they are microwave, oven, freezer, and dishwasher safe. 🍩Warm tips: 1. Use a cooking sheet or a cooking tray underneath your silicone molds to provide it with more stability. Tiscen silicone utensils are very flexible. 2. Wash them thoroughly for the first time using. 3. Never use direct heat on these baking molds. If your oven uses direct heat, it is best to protect the silicone with a metal sheet or tray at the bottom.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61niUxAT7IL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tiscen","source_asin":"B08PFBGNHV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1060599","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08PFBGNHV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08PFBGNHV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
