window.products.push({"id":1060650,"name":"Dormire Reversible Quilted Furniture Protector with Elastic Strap for Chair - Machine Washable - 70\" X 65\" - Chocolate/Beige","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813XYQ50V8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Have a child at home? How about a pet? Have a brand new piece of furniture that you want to keep looking brand new? Look no further than the Dormire Reversible Furniture Protector . It is exactly what you need to keep your furniture looking like it is on the showroom floor!  - Pets can track dirt, claw/bite, or leave unfriendly odors on your furniture. - Kids can be just as detrimental to the condition of your furniture. Features: - Protects your furniture from stains, rips, odors, dirt, fur, hair and more. - Built-in elastic strap helps prevent the protector from moving / sliding around on your furniture. - Machine Washable ( Cold ) and Tumble Dry. - Protector is reversible. One side is chocolate color and the other side is beige with a chocolate trim. Specifications: Dimensions: 70\" X 65\" Fabric: 100% Polyester Filling: Polyester Hollow Fiber Net Weight of Filling: 0.3 lbs ( 0.14 kgs ) Notes: - Great for fabric furniture. Fabric will create enough friction to keep your furniture cover in place. - This is NOT recommended for leather furniture. Leather is slippery and even with the the elastic strap, it will be hard to keep the protector in one spot. - This is NOT waterproof. It will help with spills by soaking up a lot of the spill. This is intentional as a waterproof cover will result in the liquids rolling onto the floor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813XYQ50V8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dormire","source_asin":"B01NAXPGZN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1060650","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01NAXPGZN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01NAXPGZN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
