window.products.push({"id":1060670,"name":"AKTI Cotton Luxury Bath Towels 500 GSM 27x54 Inches Pack of 4 | Premium Towel Bathroom Sets, Durable, Soft and Fluffy Extra Absorbent Towel Set for Ba","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81uyBMi042L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% COTTON & SKIN-FRIENDLYBATH TOWELS: Each towel is spun with 100% premium quality cotton, which makes them super soft, smooth, fast-absorbent, quick-dry and gentle on your skin and body. The AKTI towels are OEKO-TEK Certified to ensure the environmental and safety standards. Safe to be used for kids as it's free from all harmful substances while keeping quality, comfort and wellness intact for you and your loved ones. ABSORBENT & VALUE PACK: Highly Absorbent while keeping it gentle. We promise as wonderful absorption as any lavish Turkish towel. This value pack of soft and elegant towels, includes 4 Pcs Bath towel (27 x 54 inches). Best choice for in-budget luxury bath towel sets. LUXURY & CONVENIENCE: Its tender and cloudy soft touch will give you floating pleasure and royal feels every time. Either it’s a relaxing shower towel or a refreshing soak microfiber bath towel makes your bathing experience blissful. Its convenient size is perfect for anywhere and everywhere can be used as spa towels, salons towels, beach towels, bathroom towels, hotel towels, gym towels or poolside take them with you. SUPREME QUALITY & DURABILITY: AKTI towels are crafted with supreme quality material, with 500 GSM to ensure sumptuous, extravagant and long-lasting luxe feeling. Needle embroidery stitching adds to its durability and makes it reliable, by preventing them from shedding and fraying from long-term use or laundering. CARE INSTRUCTIONS: Wash before first use. Simply wash them in a machine with warm water and tumble dry on low, remove promptly from the dryer. Avoid using fabric softener or dryer sheets to maintain the look, feel and performance of the towel. Do not iron, before using the towel to restore the fluff and pile. Always follow care label instructions for best results.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81uyBMi042L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AKTI","source_asin":"B09Y9M6P6C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1060670","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Y9M6P6C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Y9M6P6C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
