window.products.push({"id":1060794,"name":"Vacuum Sealer Machine AP-18 Full Automatic Food Sealer Double Pumps for Continuous Works 5 Adjustable Modes Seal/Vac/Wet Vac Seal/Dry Vac Seal/Ext Vac","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814rT7c6U+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🏆【Fully Automatic with Press-free Design】Just insert the bag through the heat seal, push the button and the bag is self-sealing, say goodbye to the tedium of traditional press sealers. 🏆【5mm Sealing Wire】Our vacuum sealer uses a 5mm sealing wire, which is wider and tighter than the conventional 3mm sealing wire, and offers a better sealing solution, and it supports you to vacuum and heat sealing the inside folded bag. 🏆【Upgrade Double Pump Design】New upgraded double pump design, the reverse rotation counteracts the torque and vibration generated by both sides, effectively reducing working noise; The double pump offers a 6.4L/Min vacuum speed, 2-4 times faster then the ordinary vacuum machine, and it supports to vacuum continuously. 🏆【Built-in Electric Lifting Device】When we click on the function keys for vacuum and heat sealing operations (except Ext Vac), the built-in electric lifting device will automatically presses the vacuum slot closed, avoiding the embarrassment of not pressing the sealer into place. 🏆【5 Adjustable Modes】Our vacuum sealer machine features 5 modes of Seal/Vac/Wet Vac Seal/Dry Vac Seal/Ext Vac, according to the type of your food, you can choose the appropriate preservation method to extend the shelf life of the food; the seal temperature is also adjustable from low, normal to high. 🏆【Silicone Vacuum Seal Ring Upgrade】AP-18 vacuum sealer replaces of the old sponge vacuum ring with a silicone vacuum seal ring, corrosion and ageing resistant, offers longer service life, even cleaning-free. The heat seal is also insulated with silicone, which offers tighter fit and longer life than the old insulating cloth. At the same time, the heat sealing strip will produce ultrasonic vibrations to vibrate the water and oil away for better heat sealing.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814rT7c6U+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VERYMODEL","source_asin":"B0B6BMCXVP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1060794","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B6BMCXVP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B6BMCXVP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
