window.products.push({"id":1060810,"name":"Alux - Waterproof Oilcloth Table Cloth - Wipeable Tablecloths for Picnic - Non-Fading Plastic Table Cover with Better Than Flannel Backing - Gingham R","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81QRFShZBxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Here’s How You Can Spend Less Time Cleaning The Table & More Time With Your Loved Ones! Looking for an easy-to-clean and durable tablecloth for your patio, kitchen or picnic table? Want to take all the hassle out of cleaning the table after your kid’s birthday party? Introducing The First Choice Vinyls Premium Mom-Approved Vinyl Tablecloth! Brought to you by First Choice Vinyls, the original manufactuer of high-quality vinyl tablecloths with cotton blend backing, this problem-solving vinyl table cloth will make your life easier than ever. No need to settle for a vinyl tablecloth with flanner backing, a felt backed table cloth or a plastic table protector anymore. Our innovative Charoplex tablecloths will offer you more bang for your buck. Top 3 Reasons That Make Our Tablecloths Your First Choice: ✔️ Made To Last, Not To Fade: the combination of polyester, cotton, and vinyl films will enhance your tablecloth’s durability and make sure that the colors remain vibrant for longer. ✔️ Completely Waterproof: stop worrying about stains. Our mess-free, wipeable tablecloths will allow you to slash clean-up times and have more free time. ✔️ Ideal For Every Modern Family: perfect for families with messy-eaters, picky babies, campers, outdoor tables, picnic benches or patio tables, our multicolor oilcloths will become your go-to table covers. Need More Reasons? Fabricated In Mexico Using 100% North American Raw Materials Free Of Heavy Metals (Including Chrome, Lead, Cadmium) Available In Multiple Colors & Designs (Hibiscus Flowers) Handy Tips For First Use: Folds & Creases Will Smooth Out When Exposed To Sunlight Or Ironed On Low Through A Towel Leave Outdoors To Air If The Tablecloth Has A Natural Smell Due To The Packaging Click “Add To Cart” NOW While Supplies Last!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81QRFShZBxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Alux","source_asin":"B08LZWQ4BC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1060810","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08LZWQ4BC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08LZWQ4BC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
