window.products.push({"id":1060963,"name":"Automatic Toothpaste Dispenser,Wall Mounted Toothpaste Squeezer Kids Hands Free Squeeze Out for Home Washroom Shower Bathroom- Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51stgZE0JRL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Are you getting crazy, when you or your children squeeze toothpaste by hands, too much toothpaste being squeezed out and making a mess? This automatic toothpaste dispenser with vacuum pump design, can squeeze out certain amount of toothpaste every time you push into the toothbrush, and it will help you out that bad situation. Product Features -High quality PP plastic, safe, durable, suitable for toothpaste tube small than 1.3 cm/ 0.47 inches. -Wall mounted design and concise style, ideal accessory for bathroom, washroom or kitchen. -Dispense toothpaste without hand squeezing, prevents messing and reduces waste of toothpaste. Product Specification -Material: PP plastic -Color: White + Blue -Size: 11.5x6.4x6.2cm/ 4.5\"x2.5\"x2.4\" -Package Includes: 1 Piece Toothpaste Dispenser(Random Style) Warm Tips for Installation and Use 1. Choose the smooth wall or surface, clean and keep it dry, then stick the dispenser on it, and keep pressing for 10~30 seconds, ensuring firm bonding. 2. Squeeze the toothpaste to the tube head before it will dispense, and for the first time use, please press the button several times to remove air inside the dispenser until toothpaste comes out of the nozzle. 3. Please clean the dispenser every 5-7 days for reducing bacteria and keeping hygiene, and you can take it apart, easy to clean. 4. Please accompany and help your kids under 6 years old to use the toothpaste dispenser to avoid messing or wasting toothpaste. 5. Please note that common round-head toothbrush may be small for loading the toothpaste squeezed by the dispenser. 6. If you want to remove the dispenser from the wall, it's better to heat the back adhesive by a hair dryer before you peel it off. 7. For various factors, there may be color difference between product and picture.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51stgZE0JRL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cytheria","source_asin":"B08GFG6ZWR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1060963","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08GFG6ZWR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08GFG6ZWR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
