window.products.push({"id":1060974,"name":"Taiwon Metal & Kitchenware 18/10 stainless steel Baguette pattern Demitasse Spoon set of 12","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vV7yd6fFL._AC_SL1418_.jpg","description":"Baguette is simple and widely used pattern in Europe for many years. Depends on brand and manufacturer, Baguette has slightly different shape and angle. Taiwon Metal & Kitchenware Baguette is made of stainless 18/10 and has one clear line followed by middle of the handle. knife has hollow handle and does not have line at the middle. - Demitasse spoons - 4.4 Inches long***Material Information***18/10 and 18/0 is not the same quality of material used and vary considerably in price and composition. Stainless flatware that is 18/10 means that the material is consist of 18% chromium and 10% nickel. Similarly, 18/8 is 8% ofickel and 18/0 is 0%. The higher the nickel content, the more protection the flatware has from corrosion. Water and dishwasher detergents tend to be harsh to stainless steel flatware and that can sometimes cause blemishes. These can often be removed with a stainless steel cleanser but pitting, chipping or rusting sometimes cannot be removed. 18/10 and 18/8 are protective for rust, and these usually last much longer than 18/0.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vV7yd6fFL._AC_SL1418_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KitchenWide Corp","source_asin":"B0088W89V4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1060974","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0088W89V4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0088W89V4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
