window.products.push({"id":1060981,"name":"Pure Enrichment® PureBaby® Cloud Ultrasonic Cool Mist Humidifier - Whisper-Quiet Variable Mist for Up to 24 Hours of Mist, Color Changing Night Light,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81opHNPs9KL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"COOL MIST HUMIDIFIER FOR CHILDREN: Help your kids breathe easier throughout the night with this whimsical cool mist humidifier and night light. Thoughtfully designed and rigorously tested, this Parent Tested, Parent Approved award winner is perfect for your baby’s nursery, kid’s bedroom, or any space up to 250 sq ft that needs extra humidity. INSTANT DRY AIR RELIEF: Quiet enough for bedtime, the large 1.8L tank moisturizes rooms for up to 24 hours to create ideal humidity levels that help ease congestion, cold symptoms, dry skin, coughs, and encourage better sleep. Additionally, customize their comfort using the mist control knob to incrementally adjust the moisture output and rotate the 360° nozzle to direct the humidity wherever you need it. SOFT GLOW NIGHT LIGHT: Create a soothing environment for your baby with the optional and independent night light. Rotate through 7+ rainbow-spectrum colors or use Color Choice Technology to select your favorite color to gently lull your little one to sleep during naps or bedtime. PLAYFUL CLOUD DESIGN: Our unique patent-pending design is kid-friendly and playful, while the modern, cloud design fits on any nightstand or tabletop while beautifully complementing any nursery, kids bedroom, playroom, or other large space WHAT YOU GET: PureBaby Cloud Humidifier, AC power adapter, cleaning brush, user manual, and Pure Enrichment’s guaranteed 5-Year Warranty. Our customer support team provides daily quality service and peace of mind to millions worldwide all from a proven brand you can trust.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81opHNPs9KL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pure Enrichment","source_asin":"B07K8Y4945","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1060981","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07K8Y4945","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07K8Y4945","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
